{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a19d39cf-9368-81b4-9ac6-8d82a763c218",
  "created_at": "2026-01-06T12:20:56-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Colleen Cullen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:18:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:18:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, there's a puddle across about half the road near me that won't drain, and it hasn't rained in the better part of a month. I'm trying to find out who handles it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:18:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so standing water, no recent rain. Is it sitting right by a storm drain, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:18:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a grate at the low spot, yes. The water pools around it and just stays. It's even got a bit of a film on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:19:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Can you give me the street, or the nearest cross street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:19:14-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'd rather not give the exact address, I'm a landlord and it's by one of my rentals, but it's on the road itself. I can describe the spot. It's right where the road dips, just past the stop sign."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:19:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, I really do need a street name so the crew can find it. Even just the street, no house number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:19:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] I'd rather leave it with a callback. Can someone call me at 401-555-0170 and I'll go over the location then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:19:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. I'll note the callback number, Colleen, is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:19:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Colleen Cullen. C-U-L-L-E-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:19:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. And you said it's been like this a while?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:19:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Weeks, yes. A neighbor told me it happens every big rain, so it's apparently a known thing. But this time there's been no rain at all, so it isn't just runoff."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:20:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that does sound more like a blockage or a broken pipe than a drainage lag. I'll flag it that way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:20:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One more question. Is that a city drain or a state one? I wasn't sure who to call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:20:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on the road. State routes have their own drains, but most local streets are ours. Once I have the street I can tell you which it is, and if it's the state's, I'll give you who to contact."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:20:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:20:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in the request now and someone will call you at that number. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:20:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. I'm actually on my way to return a sweater, it's a size too small, so I should get going."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:20:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Thanks for calling, Colleen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T12:20:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Bye."
    }
  ],
